      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后来的某天，和艾尔菲一起，\n我们开始了实战形式的\n竞技介绍视频的拍摄——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9b0f72e3eed1573e4341f7455736b96ecb1a926fb43aa9d23931e2d748d39f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
