    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5877a0857388fb95b9299ca9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『动力之锤』是一项投掷大小数倍于人类\n所用的锤子的物体，\n来比试飞行距离的竞技。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f197da36da317d500ac96912853f07dff4f20b38bda8688cf5e34847d6b0e6fa",
